{"work_id":"raja-rani","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","source_scene_number":null,"source_scene_file":"works/raja-rani/scenes/scene-036.md","record_count":48,"records":[{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d001","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"யாரது? ராணியா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":53,"printed_page":52}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d002","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ம்...ஆமாம்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":53,"printed_page":52}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d003","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஹ...ஹேய்!...நாடகத்திலே நடிக்கவே மாட்டேன்னு என்கிட்ட சொன்னில்ல...நீ?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":53,"printed_page":52}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d004","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அது...அது...வந்து நான் உங்கிட்ட சொல்ல...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":54,"printed_page":53}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d005","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சரி, சரி! நான் வாங்கிக் கொடுத்த 'பிரசண்டேஷனை'யெல்லாம் இப்பவே திருப்பிக் கொடு!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":54,"printed_page":53}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d006","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அய்யய்யோ! அதையெல்லாம் உபயோகப்படுத்திட்டேனே! அது எவ்வளவு விலைன்னு சொல்லுங்க. வாங்கின விலையை அப்படியேத் திருப்பிக் கொடுத்துறிறேன்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":54,"printed_page":53}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d007","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வாங்கின விலையா? உன்கிட்ட அவசியம் சொல்லணுமா? நான் வாங்குவேன்...அல்லது திருடுவேன்...அதைப் பத்தி ஒனக்கென்னா? கிண்டலா பண்றே? உன்கிட்ட பணம் வாங்க நான் என்ன பிச்சைக்காரனா? மரியாதையா நான் வாங்கிக் கொடுத்த சேலை ரவிக்கையை திருப்பிக் கொடு. பழந்துணியா இருந்தாலும் பரவாயில்லை...குடு!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":54,"printed_page":53}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d008","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பிச்சைக்காரன் இல்லீங்கறீங்க, ஆனா பெரிய குடுகுடுப்பைக்காரனா இருப்பீங்க போலிருக்கே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":54,"printed_page":53}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d009","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இந்தக் கிண்டல், கேலி எல்லாம் உன் லெளவர் ராஜா இருக்கானே, அவன்கிட்ட வச்சுக்க! என் பிரசண்டேஷனுக்கு பதிலாக இப்ப இந்த வளையலையாவது கழட்டிக் கொடு!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":54,"printed_page":53}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d010","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ...ஈ!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":54,"printed_page":53}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d011","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"கொடு...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":54,"printed_page":53}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d012","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"சமரசம்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"டேய்...டேய்...டேய்...பாபு!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":54,"printed_page":53}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d013","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அத்தான், நான் ஒண்ணும்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":54,"printed_page":53}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d014","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பேசாதே! இந்த தோட்டம் இதுக்காகவா கட்டிப் போட்டு இருக்கிறேன்? சமரசம் வீட்ல இதுமாதிரி ஒண்ணு நடக்கக்கூடாதுடா...போடா...போடா...இந்தாம்மா!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":54,"printed_page":53}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d015","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இந்தாம்மா!...நீ வந்து...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":54,"printed_page":53}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d016","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"டேய்...போ! போன மச்சான் ஏண்டா திரும்பி வந்தே? ரண்!...ஓடு! ஆ...இந்தாம்மா, நீ இந்த நாடகத்திலே வேஷம் போட்டவதானே!...இங்க எங்க வந்தே?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":54,"printed_page":53}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d017","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாங்க; ஒங்கிட்ட ஒரு விஷயம் சொல்லலாமுன்னு வந்தேன்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":54,"printed_page":53}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d018","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"மண்ணாங்கட்டி! நீ அந்தப் பயலோடு பேசிகிட்டு இருந்ததை நான் பார்த்தேன்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":54,"printed_page":53}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d019","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அய்யய்யோ! நான் ஒண்ணும் செய்யலீங்க...அவருதான் எங்கிட்ட தகாத முறையிலே நடந்துட்டாரு...இதோ பாருங்க, என் கையை...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":54,"printed_page":53}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d020","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அய்யய்யோ!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":54,"printed_page":53}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d021","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"சாந்தம்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆஹா! இப்படி நடக்குதா? அயோக்கியத்தனத்துக்கு ஒரு அளவில்லாம போச்சு!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":54,"printed_page":53}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d022","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அதானே!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":55,"printed_page":54}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d023","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம்...நான் ஒண்ணும் பயித்தக்காரி இல்லே; ஒண்ணும் சும்மாவிடப் போறதில்லே; ஏம்மா மின்னல் கொடி! மாயப் பொடி தூவுறியா, மாயப் பொடி!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":55,"printed_page":54}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d024","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இந்தா...இந்தா...அந்தப் பொண்ணை பேசிப் பிரயோஜனமில்லே, அவனைக் கேளு!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":55,"printed_page":54}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d025","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ...ஆ...! அவனைக் கேக்க வேண்டியதுதான்! ஏண்டா நீ என்கூடப் பொறந்த தம்பியா? இப்படியெல்லாம் நடக்குதுதே, நீ பாத்துக்கிட்டுத்தானே இருக்கிறே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":55,"printed_page":54}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d026","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்னக்காக...இது?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":55,"printed_page":54}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d027","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"தினம் தினம் இவ இங்க வர்றதும், இந்த நந்தவனத்திலே ஓடியாடி விளையாடுறதும், அய்யோ!...அய்யோ!...கர்மம்...கர்மம்! என் தலையிலே எழுத்து...இந்த கெழட்டு வயசுலே...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":55,"printed_page":54}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d028","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஏ...ஏ...! என்ன அவனைப்போயி கிழவங்கறே...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":55,"printed_page":54}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d029","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம் உம்...அவனை சொல்லலே, அய்யா! அவனை ஒண்ணும் சொல்லலே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":55,"printed_page":54}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d030","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இங்கே...வேற யாரு கிழவன்?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":55,"printed_page":54}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d031","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம்...உம்மைதான்யா சொல்றேன்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":55,"printed_page":54}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d032","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்னையா? என்னையா? கெழவன்னுட்டியா? நான் கெழவனா...ஏ, மச்சான்?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":55,"printed_page":54}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d033","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆனா செய்கையிலே ஒண்ணும் கெழட்டுத்தனம் இல்லே!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":55,"printed_page":54}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d034","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இந்தா புள்ளே! என் புருஷன்தானா கெடச்சான் நீ ஓடிப்புடிச்சு விளையாடுறதுக்கு?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":55,"printed_page":54}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d035","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்னம்மா இது, நீங்க பாட்டுக்கு ஏதேதோ பேசிகிட்டே போறீங்களே?...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":55,"printed_page":54}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d036","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்ன சொன்னே?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":55,"printed_page":54}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d037","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஏய்! இந்தா, நீ பேயில்ல; பொம்பளை!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":55,"printed_page":54}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d038","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"போடி வெளியே! இன்னொரு தரம் இந்தக் காம்பவுண்ட்டுக்குள்ளே காலை வச்சே, காலை ஒடிச்சுபுடுவேன்! ஜாக்ரதை!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":55,"printed_page":54}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d039","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இந்தா...இந்தா...இந்தாபாரு, இந்த காம்பவுண்ட்ல பாதி எனக்கு சொந்தம்! நீ, பாதி வரலாம்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":55,"printed_page":54}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d040","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":55,"printed_page":54}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d041","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இந்தா...இந்தா...நீ வந்துடு!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":55,"printed_page":54}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d042","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆகா! அவ்வளவு தூரத்துக்கு ஆயிப்போச்சா? இவுங்களை சும்மாவிடக்கூடாது!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":55,"printed_page":54}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d043","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாம்!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":56,"printed_page":55}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d044","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பாபு...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":56,"printed_page":55}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d045","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"யக்கா...?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":56,"printed_page":55}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d046","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நீ இவுங்களை 'பாலோ' பண்ணு...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":56,"printed_page":55}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d047","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இப்பவே பண்றேன்...அப்ப கொஞ்சம் பணம் வேணும்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":56,"printed_page":55}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s036-d048","scene_id":"raja-rani-s036","scene_ordinal":36,"transition_audit_id":"T036","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"தர்ரேன் வா!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":56,"printed_page":55}],"source_scene_file":"scene-036.md"}]}
